==Strategy==
After a long time off from ruining players' days in [[Into the Future]], LeMurr finally returns as arguably the biggest nuisance in the stage, and this time she's brought plenty of company. These LeMurrs are the strongest ones you've seen up this point, so it's advised that you lure them to the [[Cat Base]] to deal with them alone. Try to hit them with at least two attacks from [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Other than that, you'll be needing a lot of ranged attackers to counter the backlines - [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] are standard choices for a no-[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] strategy.

For meatshields, go with the standard [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]], [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], and either [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]] or [[Kyubey Cat (Rare Cat)|Kyubey Cat]]. Other useful assets include [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]].

Any decent [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] Uber/[[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] is obviously of use. [[Takeda Shingen (Uber Rare Cat)|Wargod Shingen]], [[Gunduros (Uber Rare Cat)|Ballistic Dragon Gunduros]], and [[Warlock and Pierre (Uber Rare Cat)|Mad Doctor Klay]] in particular have great stats, while [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Megaphrodite]] and [[Sharpshooter Saki (Uber Rare Cat)|Sharpshooter Saki]] can be used to snipe the Calamaries.

A way to cheese this stage for {{4c}} is by using [[Talents|Talented]] Awakened Bahamut Cat,[[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite Cat]], [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]] and [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] Cannon with [[Biohazard (Combo)|Hazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]], as well as [[Mini-Saurus (Combo)|Mini-Saurus]]. Start by stalling until you have money to spawn Awakened Bahamut Cat, then, start spamming Catellite Cat, after Bahamut hits the base, use Breakerblast and start spamming Stone Cat with Catellite, it will stall the enemies behind the base allowing Bahamut to easily destroy it.

